senses.gloss:
स्नु 2. स्नु, उस्, उ, m. n. (a defective word
optionally substituted for सानु, q. v., in certain cases;
according to some fr. rt. 1. सो), the level summit or
edge of a mountain, table-land; any top, surface;
anything fixed or stationary (as the firmament; Sāy.
= स्थित, Ṛg-veda IV. 28, 2).
